    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit, my name is Bob. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769045144066665
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Bob, I need to make a return for some road cycling shoes I bought.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66123,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769045149066665
    },
    {
      "text": "No problem, I can definitely help you with that. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769045153866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF88612. I've had them for a little while, so I hope it's not too late.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66123,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769045159666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me just pull that up... Okay, I see the order. Looks like they were delivered about 76 days ago. That's perfectly fine. Our policy allows for returns within 10 days of delivery.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769045165266665
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, great! I wasn't sure. So I can send them back?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66123,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769045177533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Absolutely. I've just processed the return authorization. I can email you a prepaid return label right now. Will the email on file work for you?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 201,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769045181066664
    },
    {
      "text": "That's fantastic, yes, that email is perfect. Thank you so much!",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66123,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769045190866664
    },
    {
